  "goodToKnow": "Der Tarif is a rate or price plan: der Handytarif, der Stromtarif. In the world of work, der Tarif or Tarifvertrag is a collective agreement between unions and employers that sets pay; nach Tarif bezahlt werden means to be paid on the agreed scale. Die Tarifrunde is a round of wage talks, often with Warnstreiks (warning strikes). Customs duties, however, are der Zoll: Trump's Zölle, not Tarife. Stress: ta-REEF."
